import{_ as i,o as n,c as o,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 964 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 30 | Law-Anchor Permission Universalization","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 964 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 30 | Law-Anchor Permission Universalization","no":964,"module":5,"tags":["Heavenly-Dao Rule","Rule 30","Law-Anchor Permission","Universalization","Myriad-Rank Republicanism"],"related":["20-Anchor Structure and Hierarchy","914-Law-Anchor Permission Universalization","963-Civilizational-Weight Assessment"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0964_模块5-规则三十-法则锚定权限普惠.md","filePath":"en/0964_模块5-规则三十-法则锚定权限普惠.md"}'),s={name:"en/0964_模块5-规则三十-法则锚定权限普惠.md"};function t(r,e,l,c,u,h){return n(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-964-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-30-law-anchor-permission-universalization" tabindex="-1">Entry 964 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 30 | Law-Anchor Permission Universalization <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-964-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-30-law-anchor-permission-universalization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 964 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 30 | Law-Anchor Permission Universalization&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Document 20 | Series: Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-even-law-access-rights-must-be-everyone-s-share" tabindex="-1">Introduction: even law-access rights must be everyone&#39;s share <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-even-law-access-rights-must-be-everyone-s-share" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: even law-access rights must be everyone&#39;s share&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The last few Heavenly-Dao rules land on the hardest technical layer — law-anchor permissions. In the old cosmos, those who could directly converse with law and invoke law&#39;s power were always a few prodigies, a few sects, a few bloodlines. Most beings spent a lifetime only &quot;borrowing force,&quot; never even touching law&#39;s door. Heavenly-Dao Rule 30 must universalize even this door to Myriad Ranks: law-anchor permission is not the strong&#39;s exclusive, but the basic qualification every being of Myriad Ranks possesses. How deep a law you may anchor may differ by effort; but &quot;whether you may anchor&quot; is something everyone can.</p><p>The six top-level axioms land on the technical layer here: the republican axiom of Myriad Races is this rule&#39;s body, directly requiring law-anchor permission universalization; the anti-predation axiom negates &quot;law-access monopoly&quot;; the collective-ascension axiom makes universalized permission the technical precondition for Myriad Ranks&#39; joint ascension; the causal self-discipline axiom requires open permissions still under multi-layer supervision; the law-first axiom lets &quot;permission tiers, application, renewal&quot; be stipulated first by law; Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law gives universalization its deepest confidence — since every being inherently possesses basic infinite power, he naturally qualifies to access the law network to activate this infinity; easygoing ones need not anchor deep layers, but the floor access right is forever theirs; strivers and Youth Supremes may by effort anchor deeper layers and more laws.</p><h2 id="i-rule-content-three-points-of-permission-universalization" tabindex="-1">I. Rule Content: Three Points of Permission Universalization <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-rule-content-three-points-of-permission-universalization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Rule Content: Three Points of Permission Universalization&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Basic permission for all</strong>: every being is born with basic law-anchor permission, no application, no review;</li><li><strong>Deeper permission by effort</strong>: deeper, stronger law-anchor permissions are unlocked step by step by realm, contribution, and heart-nature, not by bloodline, not by grace;</li><li><strong>Permissions may not be privately granted or monopolized</strong>: no strong one may &quot;transfer&quot; his own anchor permission to specific disciples to manufacture dependence, nor block some law&#39;s access.</li></ol><p>Universalization is not equalization — strivers may anchor more, easygoing ones may rest on the basics.</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anchor-structure argument</strong>: the Anchor Structure and Hierarchy (Document 20) points out the law network opens interfaces to all nodes; monopolizing access is originally man-made tolls;</li><li><strong>Infinite-origin argument</strong>: under Axiom 6, everyone inherently possesses infinite origin; accessing the law network is only &quot;activating&quot; what one already has, not &quot;receiving&quot; external grace;</li><li><strong>Anti-dependence argument</strong>: the old cosmos&#39;s dependence structure of &quot;only joining a sect earns law recognition&quot; essentially takes access rights hostage; universalization removes the hostage.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-execution-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. Execution Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-execution-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Execution Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>The Alaya Network automatically opens a &quot;law-anchor permission account&quot; for every being, with basic permission on by default;</li><li>Deeper permissions are unlocked step by step via the plane-sovereign strong-one four-dimensional assessment (Entry 911) and contracted-responsibility contribution;</li><li>Permission use is fully under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, preventing &quot;universalized but abused&quot;;</li><li>For beings of newly incorporated civilizations, their basic access right opens automatically with network entry.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Light</strong>: permission-upgrade process not smooth, investigate within a time limit;</li><li><strong>Medium</strong>: setting up tolls, privately granting permissions to manufacture dependence, relevant persons&#39; permissions frozen, enters conversion program;</li><li><strong>Heavy</strong>: monopolizing some law&#39;s access, using &quot;cutting off your access&quot; to coerce Myriad Ranks, handled heavily under Rules 5 and 19.</li></ul><h2 id="v-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">V. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision&#39;s permission-account system is the first layer; the Anchor Supervisory Committee checks access monopoly as the second layer; the Symbiotic Court adjudicates permission-infringement cases as the third layer; Myriad Ranks&#39; clans have direct appeal over &quot;whether their own access is tolled&quot; as the fourth layer.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: opening law-access rights, Myriad Ranks simultaneously activate infinite origin, whole-system energy leaps</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: dismantling &quot;access monopoly,&quot; predation&#39;s technical base; under Axiom 6 everyone inherently qualifies to access</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type systems&#39; law recognition follows the protagonist halo, most never touch it in a lifetime; Heng Yuan Zhou basic permission opens at birth</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the five lineages, easygoing and strivers, Youth Supremes, and planet consciousness each have permission accounts</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: new planes incorporated, their beings automatically gain basic access rights</li></ul><p>Law-anchor permission universalization must also answer: everyone has basic permission, will it be chaotic? Heavenly-Dao rules&#39; answer is that basic permission&#39;s design is itself safe — it only lets beings access law nodes matching their realm, with deeper nodes unlocked by effort. Universalization does not equal danger, because access rights are tiered: you may touch the door, but how deep behind depends on how far you walk. This &quot;universalization plus tiering&quot; design both breaks the old cosmos&#39;s monopoly and avoids &quot;everyone invoking laws&quot; chaos. Permission universalization is not permission flood.</p><p>Law-anchor permission universalization must also emphasize: universalization does not mean automatically growing strong. Basic permission only lets you &quot;be able&quot; to access; after access, how deep you anchor and how well you use it still depend on your effort, heart-nature, and contribution. What universalization dismantles is the wall of &quot;not letting you through the door,&quot; not the ladder of &quot;reaching the summit upon entering.&quot; Easygoing ones may rest on the basics; strivers climb by effort — permission universalization gives a fair starting point, not an equalized terminus.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-anchor permission universalization turns &quot;conversing with law&quot; from a few prodigies&#39; privilege into a daily thing accessible to all Myriad Ranks.</p><p>In the end, the Rule 30 described in this entry — law-anchor permission universalization — is no isolated case; it consistently points to the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s co-construction direction.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/20-锚点结构与层级.html">Entry 20 · Anchor Structure and Hierarchy</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/914_模块5-第十三条-法则锚定权限普惠.html">Entry 914 · Law-Anchor Permission Universalization</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/963_模块5-规则二十九-文明权重评估.html">Entry 963 · Rule 29 Civilizational-Weight Assessment</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/965_模块5-规则三十一-万族本源双向循环.html">Entry 965 · Rule 31 Myriad-Rank Origin Two-Way Cycle</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const p=i(s,[["render",t]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
